      "title": "這是什麼範本 / What this template is",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 角色立繪 / 定裝照（Flux）\n\n和武俠範本同一條 Flux 流程，只是換成直式 896×1152、步數 20，專門生「一個角色的定裝照」。生出來的圖可以直接餵給第三支範本（參考圖生影片），讓同一張臉動起來。\n\n預設提示詞是《薩里沙方陣》那部片裡主角 Amyntas 的設定，可以照著它的結構改：**人物 → 年紀外貌 → 服裝道具 → 時代場景 → 光線 → 鏡位**。\n\n**怎麼用：** 只改中間紫框裡的提示詞 → 按右上角 Run → 等 worker 跑完 → 圖出現在最右邊的\n`SaveImage` 節點。其他節點看註解就好，不用動。\n\n**注意：** 節點下拉選單裡的模型檔名，來自聯邦裡「目前在線」的 worker。\n沒有 worker 在線時下拉會是空的，送出也會失敗。\n\n---\n\n# Character portrait / reference sheet (Flux)\n\nThe same Flux pipeline in portrait orientation (896x1152, 20 steps), tuned for one-character reference shots. Feed the result into the ref2v template to make that same face move. The default prompt is the Amyntas character sheet from the Sarissa documentary; keep its structure: subject -> age/looks -> costume -> period setting -> light -> framing.\n\n**How to use:** edit the prompt in the purple group, press Run, wait for a\nworker, and the picture appears in the `SaveImage` node on the right. Model\ndropdowns are populated from the workers that are online right now."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        0,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        340,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 14,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "① 模型載入器 / Model loaders",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n這一區是「模型載入器」，把三個檔案讀進來：\n\n- `UNETLoader` — 主模型（畫圖的腦袋），這裡用 `flux1-dev.safetensors`。\n- `DualCLIPLoader` — 兩個文字編碼器，負責把你的文字翻譯成模型看得懂的東西。\n- `VAELoader` — 把模型算出來的潛在影像還原成看得到的圖片。\n\n**新手不用動這一區。** 檔名下拉選單列出的是聯邦裡目前線上 worker 有的檔案；\n如果下拉是空的，代表現在沒有在線的 worker。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nModel loaders: the diffusion model, the two text encoders, and the VAE.\nNovices should leave this group alone. The dropdown lists the files that the\nonline federation workers actually have; an empty dropdown means no worker is\nonline right now."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        400,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        480,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 15,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "② 提示詞 / Prompt",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 你只需要改這裡**\n\n紅框裡的 `CLIPTextEncode` 就是提示詞。把裡面的英文換成你想要的畫面描述即可，\n其餘節點都不用碰。\n\n寫法建議：**主體 → 動作/姿勢 → 場景 → 光線 → 風格/鏡頭**，用逗號分隔，全部用英文。\n例如 `a wuxia swordsman, hand on sword hilt, misty bamboo ridge at dawn,\ngolden rim light, photorealistic, 35mm film grain`。\n\n`FluxGuidance` 的 `guidance` 預設 3.5：數字越大越貼近提示詞、但越容易僵硬；\n2.5～4.0 之間都算安全範圍。\n\n---\n\n**English — this is the only group you need to edit**\n\nReplace the text inside `CLIPTextEncode` with your own scene description\n(subject → action → setting → light → style, comma separated, in English).\n`FluxGuidance` defaults to 3.5; 2.5–4.0 is the safe range."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        900,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        640,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 16,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "③ 取樣參數 / Sampler",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 取樣參數什麼時候要動**\n\n- `EmptySD3LatentImage` 的 `width`/`height` = 出圖尺寸。改成 16 的倍數；\n  尺寸越大越慢也越吃 VRAM。\n- `BasicScheduler` 的 `steps` = 疊代次數。步數越多越細緻、也越慢。\n  **想快速試提示詞就調小（8 步約幾秒），滿意了再調回 20～28 出正式圖。**\n- `RandomNoise` 的 `noise_seed` = 亂數種子。**同一組提示詞＋同一個種子 = 同一張圖**；\n  想換一張就改種子（或把後面的控制設成 randomize）。\n- `KSamplerSelect` 的 `euler` 和 `BasicScheduler` 的 `simple` 是 Flux 的標準組合，\n  沒有特別理由不用改。\n\n---\n\n**English — when to touch the sampler**\n\nWidth/height set the output size (multiples of 16). `steps` trades speed for\ndetail — 8 for quick prompt tests, 20–28 for finals. Same prompt + same\n`noise_seed` = the same picture; change the seed for a different one. Leave\n`euler` + `simple` alone; that is the standard Flux pairing."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1580,
        -420
