      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 17,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "④ 輸出 / Output",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 輸出在哪裡看**\n\n`SaveImage` 是輸出節點。按下右上角的 **Run / Queue** 之後：\n\n1. 這張工作流會變成一個聯邦 job，派給線上的 worker 執行。\n2. 進度會在畫面上跑；完成後圖片直接顯示在這個節點裡。\n3. 同一張圖也會出現在 Console 的「工作」頁面，可以下載或查收據。\n\n`filename_prefix` 只是檔名前綴，想分類的話可以寫成 `wuxia/shot`。\n\n---\n\n**English — where the result shows up**\n\n`SaveImage` is the output node. Hit Run/Queue: the graph becomes a federation\njob, a worker runs it, and the image appears in this node when it finishes.\nThe same file is listed on the console's Jobs page with its receipt."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
